# plans/M10.md item A2d / B2 / B3 / B4 / C / D
# Always-loaded runtime module. Names are not auto-visible (decision 584);
# harness reaches helpers via force-rooted CalleeKeys + Asm::bl_call_key.
module runtime

# plans/M11.md item D / E / F / G / H: import the generated facts module.
# Batch-1 injects a stub `core.__image_runtime` (decision 780); live images
# replace it with `rtconfig::generate_with` before force-rooting runtime keys.
# Fixed stub pools (decision 791 / 802 / 812) are always imported so spliced
# match ladders can Call them (sema forbids reaching non-imported helpers).
# M12 item E: INIT_SPAN0..INIT_SPAN_POOL_COUNT-1 are always imported (span
# pool); boot_init zeros live spans via __wrela_init_* (`N_INIT_SLOTS`).
